<v John Borg>That's what he said, he's going to put me in the show. "I'm going to give you a wonderful part in the movie." And I don't get [BLEEP], not even one minute. He promised me he's going to put me in a movie, and everything else, but he never have.
<v John Borg>他是这么说的，他要让我上镜。“我要给你电影里一个很棒的角色。”但我连[消音]都没得到，一分钟都没有。他承诺让我演电影，还有别的什么，但他从来没兑现过。

