<v Alex Blumberg>This is Richard Castellano quoting other people's lines from the movie in which he played a bit role, Analyze This . In our two-hour interview in his lawyer's office, he was defensive and guarded, until I asked him about his favorite actors and favorite movie scenes. He stood up, rubbed his hands together, and got into character.
<v Alex Blumberg>这是理查德·卡斯特拉诺在引用他客串的那部电影《老大靠边闪》中别人的台词。在我们律师办公室的两个小时采访中，他一直处于防备和戒备状态，直到我问起他最喜欢的演员和电影场景。他站起来，双手搓在一起，进入了角色。

